                                                                                
                                                                                
        ╭─ help ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮        
        │ Keys                                                         │        
        │                                                              │        
        │   1-7               switch screen                            │        
        │   tab / shift+tab   next / previous screen, or cycle filter  │        
        │   ← →               move the chart cursor                    │        
        │   j k / ↑ ↓         move in tables and scroll raw data       │        
        │   r                 refresh now                              │        
        │   m                 toggle motion                            │        
        │   t                 jump to today / current period           │        
        │   s l g b           toggle Today series (solar, load, grid,… │        
        │   h l               previous / next period in History        │        
        │   e                 export JSON or CSV                       │        
        │   d                 re-discover the inverter (Diagnostics o… │        
        │   ?                 close this help                          │        
        │   q                 quit                                     │        
        │                                                              │        
        │ Mouse: click tabs, tiles and chart; wheel scrolls lists.     │        
        ╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯        
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                